choice or an answer, a question,

236
00:13:07,810 --> 00:13:09,010
it looks really obvious.

237
00:13:09,910 --> 00:13:11,787
And then you might start second guessing
yourself.

238
00:13:11,870 --> 00:13:13,147
Well, what's the catch here?

239
00:13:13,230 --> 00:13:16,180
No, sometimes the simplest solution will
be the correct one.

240
00:13:17,110 --> 00:13:19,410
Never, never leave a question blank.

241
00:13:20,130 --> 00:13:21,530
There's no negative marking.

242
00:13:22,310 --> 00:13:24,270
If you have to guess, then guess.

243
00:13:24,790 --> 00:13:26,440
But never leave a question blank.

